<p class="form-note">Passwords are one-way hashed before storage. Existing passwords are never displayed or repopulated.</p>
<div class="field"><label for="avatar">Avatar <span>optional</span></label><input id="avatar" name="avatar" type="file" accept="image/jpeg,image/png" data-image-input data-preview-target="staff-avatar-preview" <?= isset($errors['avatar']) ? 'aria-invalid="true" aria-describedby="avatar-help avatar-error"' : 'aria-describedby="avatar-help"' ?>><small id="avatar-help">Genuine JPG or PNG, up to 2 MB. GROOVE prepares an 800 × 800 image.</small><small class="field-error" id="avatar-error"><?= esc($errors['avatar'] ?? '') ?></small></div>
